    VALUES ('Discussing a Bulk Discount', 'I see that the unit price is twelve dollars. If we order five hundred units instead of two hundred, can you offer a better price? Let me check with my manager. For orders over four hundred units, we usually give a ten percent discount. So the price would be ten dollars and eighty cents per unit. That sounds reasonable. Let me discuss it with my team and get back to you by Friday.', 'listening', 'A2', 'negotiation')
  RETURNING id
)
