    VALUES ('Returning Wireless Headphones', 'Hello, I bought these wireless headphones last Saturday, but the left ear stopped working after two days. I still have the receipt and the original box. I would like a replacement, please, not a refund. Of course. Let me check if we have the same model in stock. Yes, we do. I will swap them for you right now. Would you also like a one-year extended warranty? It costs fifteen dollars. No, thank you. The standard warranty is fine.', 'listening', 'A2', 'customer_service')
